From b14cbb33a230aab3c1de32812e6db28dc2fd88fe Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: tumredsun <tumredsun@localhost>
Date: Wed, 21 Oct 2026 06:02:02 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 12/39] net: stmmac: add Allwinner A733 GMAC-210 glue

---
 drivers/net/ethernet/stmicro/stmmac/Kconfig   |  11 ++
 drivers/net/ethernet/stmicro/stmmac/Makefile  |   1 +
 .../ethernet/stmicro/stmmac/dwmac-sun60i.c    | 156 ++++++++++++++++++
 3 files changed, 168 insertions(+)
